{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65fd006234c4ab293008cc1b2311ff4bfdea5aeca6307a8358c4e1b277fd54de",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f246ad1966514072c957e40dbb7406f3803ab313dcedb11dd1bd62d7adbded4",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n我现在稍微在想一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34083f3be619d1f79677a6aa7b0cbf91bb7350c3839a9009845740e3ed1c43e",
      "text": "虽然走秀结束了，不过台步课程，\n能再帮我多安排一段时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b206225b04a96b78000fb69f6106bf08246fc00deb6b6e5bf73afff42ffd7d2",
      "text": "我今天走在T台上的时候，\n感觉简直不像自己了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f4d40d3ffd0c6227b4a744b8d49ed5492251f0e47204471e59dad01a61b5bfb",
      "text": "怎么说呢，就像是脊梁比平时挺得更直了一样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f31ff5c76e9f02a4369143b7612c49ff57673d0f1173cdbbe020ccbe2c19dbbd",
      "text": "所以我想继续上课，把这种感觉\n切实变成属于我自己的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59b17239630a5990112aec543321c38ccba573bfe6a3362f04b30977bbd1cfe5",
      "text": "明白了\n我会去安排的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:980172cb006ba827fb5426bb9e16c36769e6515f69de593a987efe843712bd58",
      "text": "请不要\n太勉强自己哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a84c974adc71db66f58f3da5e537d2e0f488b06148b8fdabfa84ba06afe9743",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n我会加油的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98412acd823faeb6a1de45773cde0a0c48b3ba1df897ff6f6bc1d077714db223",
      "text": "好的！我打算一步一步\n慢慢提升自己。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:006tsu_402_2_4_006_02_09_a:2_4_006_02_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7622ad4c5596482e9d6cf2071f24f46eeb14764d56ab5f8032a97b52ada64b56",
      "text": "我觉得这一定也能让我作为偶像有所成长。\n请注视着我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
